68-## QA issue fix workflow
69-Go to /qa/issues kanban board. start fixing all issues entried there one by one. steps:
70-  - move one issue task from todo to in progress.
71-  - verify the issue, it's original task and qa plan. and investigate the codebase
72-  - create a plan first to fix the issue.
73-  - then fix it, verify the code. no need linting o phpcs checking , skip them.
74-  - verify the issue is properly fixed by running the browser test agin.
75-  - after it's fixed, move it to closed. if not fixed and cant fix yet, move it to blocked.
