+# D07 afternoon cross-subscription Stripe metadata recurrence
+
+Read-only observation: 2026-08-09, before the SLT-MYA-04 original charge gate. No action was forced and no record was changed.
+
+Affected subscription: 12655 (SLT Signup Fee Daily, customer 347)
+Unrelated paid order: 13466, relationship-owned by subscription 11959
+
+## Exact facts
+
+- The relationship-exact SLT-MYA-04 order 13442 completed for $9.00 with HPOS transaction ch_3U2PByJG5OzSNVs21G72Ggvi at 2026-08-09 05:22:41Z.
+- Subscription 12655 nevertheless now stores _last_gateway_transaction_id=ch_3U2TD7JG5OzSNVs200AFSQM2.
+- That stored transaction belongs to unrelated completed $10.00 order 13466 for subscription 11959, created at 2026-08-09 09:38:03Z.
+- Subscription 12655 received notes 13470 and 13471 at 09:40:07Z/09:40:08Z, both saying Stripe payment was confirmed for unrelated order 13466.
+- Subscription 12655 otherwise remains on next payment 2026-08-10 10:44:10Z with completed payments 5 and last payment 2026-08-09 05:22:41Z.
+- Card metadata remains Visa ending 4242; no payment credential was printed or stored.
+
+This is a recurrence of the already-filed cross-subscription manual-payment defect:
+issues/SLT-EML-02-manual-payment-updates-wrong-subscription.md
+
+For SLT-MYA-04's 17:19:21 no-op assertion, compare the exact action/order/cycle set. Do not demand whole-subscription-meta equality because this unrelated mutation occurred before the gate.
