+# D07 afternoon Paddle renewal evidence — subscription 12639
+
+Observation date: 2026-08-09 (D07)
+Context: watch-level natural Paddle sandbox renewal; no Action Scheduler row was run and no state was mutated.
+
+## Immutable pre-gate boundary
+
+- Authored remote gate: 2026-08-09T10:20:38.143985Z / 16:20:38.143985 site (UTC+6)
+- Baseline captured: 2026-08-09 16:15:41 site
+- MAIL_PRE: 3suwtzFDriAtZ35sOOVElB
+- Pre-state: subscription 12639 arraysubs-active; local next payment 2026-08-10 10:20:38Z; completed payments 4.
+- Local actions 16005/16006 were pending for D8, not executed or forced.
+
+## Exact Paddle source-of-truth result
+
+- Transaction: txn_01kzk0mpqxf7w1tpdcdyna8n9v
+- Status/origin: completed / subscription_recurring
+- Paddle subscription: sub_01kz8q1025tryjfgxvn5e3v4gf
+- Created: 2026-08-09T10:21:06.224935Z
+- Billed: 2026-08-09T10:21:06.173447Z
+- Updated: 2026-08-09T10:21:09.937956Z
+- Total: 1100 USD minor units ($11.00)
+- Payment: captured at 2026-08-09T10:21:08.359038Z using card Visa ending 5556
+- Remote subscription remains active, automatic, day/1; next_billed_at is 2026-08-10T10:20:38.143985Z.
+- API credential, management URLs, customer payload, address payload, and full payment payload were omitted from output and were not stored.
+
+## Exact local relationship result
+
+- HPOS order 13480 was resolved uniquely by the exact Paddle transaction ID plus customer 352 and gateway arraysubs_paddle; it was not selected by recency.
+- Order 13480: wc-completed, shop_order, $11.00 USD, transaction txn_01kzk0mpqxf7w1tpdcdyna8n9v, created 2026-08-09 10:21:14Z.
+- Reverse meta present: _is_renewal_order=yes, _subscription_id=12639, _subscription_renewal=12639, _subscription_payment_processed=yes, _arraysubs_renewal_payment_success_email_sent=yes.
+- Order meta absent: _paddle_transaction_id and _last_gateway_transaction_id.
+- Order item rows: 0.
+- Exact order notes: 1429 retroactive renewal order for 12639; 1430 Paddle payment with the exact transaction; 1431 New order email sent.
+
+## Mailpit delta from MAIL_PRE
+
+Exactly two messages appeared before the baseline row:
+
+1. 5GSsdYtQfOf63LccnkfQaD — [mirror-help.arrayhash.com]: You've got a new order: #13480 — admin@mirror-help.arrayhash.com — 2026-08-09 16:21:16 site.
+2. 3jUrzcrxsS5qMrFvzDePXI — [mirror-help.arrayhash.com] Payment received for subscription #12639 — slt-paddle@example.test — 2026-08-09 16:21:17 site.
+
+The customer message reports $11.00 and local next payment 11 August 2026 16:20 site. The admin message has no product row, matching the zero order-item count.
+
+## Post-state and persisted defects
+
+- Subscription 12639 remains arraysubs-active; completed payments advanced 4 to 5.
+- Local next payment is 2026-08-11 10:20:38Z, while Paddle next_billed_at is 2026-08-10T10:20:38.143985Z: the previously filed one-day local schedule skew persists.
+- Local card metadata remains Visa ending 4242, while the captured remote payment used Visa ending 5556: the previously filed stale-card defect persists.
+- Local actions 16005/16006 were canceled unattempted. Replacement actions 16405/16406 are pending for 2026-08-11 04:26:48Z and 10:26:48Z, respectively.
+- The new paid renewal order again has no authored transaction-meta rows and no line items: the previously filed order-persistence defect recurred.
+- No retry row or failed lifecycle action was observed.
+
+Existing findings updated rather than duplicated:
+
+- issues/SLT-MYA-03-payment-method-change-treated-as-zero-dollar-renewal.md
+- issues/SLT-MYA-03-missing-local-paddle-payment-method-update-surface.md
+- issues/SLT-MYA-03-paddle-renewal-order-omits-transaction-meta-and-line-item.md
