+# D07 afternoon cross-subscription Stripe metadata recurrence
+
+Read-only observation: 2026-08-09, before the SLT-MYA-04 original charge gate. No action was forced and no record was changed.
+
+Affected subscription: 12655 (SLT Signup Fee Daily, customer 347)
+Unrelated paid order: 13466, relationship-owned by subscription 11959
+
